WEBVTT

00:00:01.520 --> 00:00:04.970
We're here at the final round of 
the Vanguard National Championship!

00:00:04.970 --> 00:00:06.600
The second match is over!

00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:10.700
At the moment, Team AL4 and Team Q4

00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:13.580
have one win each, making them even!

00:00:14.010 --> 00:00:18.640
You know, to be honest, I never 
imagined Q4 would be so tenacious.

00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:20.660
It shows my lack of imagination, doesn't it?

00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:22.790
All right, the third match 
is almost upon us!

00:00:22.790 --> 00:00:25.370
Everything will be settled here!

00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:27.430
Which will win?!

00:00:27.110 --> 00:00:30.030
Ren Suzugamori         Aichi Sendou

00:00:27.430 --> 00:00:29.460
This is s-<i>o</i> exciting!

00:02:00.080 --> 00:02:03.450
Ren Suzugamori         Aichi Sendou

00:02:03.870 --> 00:02:09.390
If I win this fight, it'll be AL4's third 
victory in a row at the national championship.

00:02:09.950 --> 00:02:14.750
Right. I'm sure more people than 
ever will want to join Foo Fighter.

00:02:14.960 --> 00:02:17.230
We'll expand the organization.

00:02:17.910 --> 00:02:21.160
Not only in Japan, but the world...

00:02:26.260 --> 00:02:29.380
It will be simplicity itself, with my power.

00:02:39.030 --> 00:02:42.740
What's that look for? You're 
frightened, aren't you?

00:02:42.740 --> 00:02:43.580
Ren...

00:02:44.300 --> 00:02:46.730
Are you afraid of this power?

00:02:47.060 --> 00:02:51.880
As wonderful as the power is, even you 
are trying to distance yourself from it?

00:02:52.600 --> 00:02:54.060
I...

00:03:20.890 --> 00:03:23.430
No one can defy this power.

00:03:29.030 --> 00:03:34.380
And eventually, all people will fall 
on their knees before my power.

00:03:40.510 --> 00:03:45.480
Two Powers, Side-by-Side

00:03:49.280 --> 00:03:51.180
I know I felt it...

00:03:51.180 --> 00:03:52.690
Ren's Psyqualia...

00:03:59.340 --> 00:04:02.630
Kai encountered that power last night...

00:04:03.600 --> 00:04:05.930
Go back to being the guy you used to be!

00:04:08.140 --> 00:04:11.000
Kai went all out,

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:15.160
while appealing to Ren as a 
friend with heart and soul.

00:04:15.160 --> 00:04:17.200
But... Ren...

00:04:18.350 --> 00:04:19.290
Oh, Kai...

00:04:21.530 --> 00:04:22.830
Brother?

00:04:23.290 --> 00:04:25.450
Let me guess! You're nervous, huh?

00:04:26.540 --> 00:04:29.190
It's gonna be okay! Have 
confidence in yourself!

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:32.460
I know you'll be able to beat 
Ren hands down, Brother!

00:04:32.460 --> 00:04:34.190
You've seriously gotten stronger!

00:04:34.510 --> 00:04:36.360
Kamui's right.

00:04:36.750 --> 00:04:40.510
Ever since we first met, you've 
been growing in strength.

00:04:40.510 --> 00:04:41.690
Misaki...

00:04:42.100 --> 00:04:43.310
Indeed.

00:04:43.910 --> 00:04:48.420
Since you started Vanguard, Aichi, 
you've had plenty of fights,

00:04:48.420 --> 00:04:51.160
and made all kinds of friends and rivals.

00:04:53.110 --> 00:04:55.450
You better not lose, Aichi!

00:04:55.450 --> 00:04:56.250
Everyone...

00:04:59.750 --> 00:05:00.730
Aichi...

00:05:03.790 --> 00:05:04.860
Kai...

00:05:06.020 --> 00:05:09.210
All of those accumulated fights 
have made you stronger, Aichi.

00:05:10.150 --> 00:05:12.720
So strong that we all feel 
the need to remark on it.

00:05:13.850 --> 00:05:16.760
That's why I just know 
you're gonna win, Brother!

00:05:18.460 --> 00:05:19.420
Uh huh.

00:05:21.330 --> 00:05:23.280
Thank you, everyone.

00:05:25.750 --> 00:05:28.700
Before, Ren Suzugamori's Psyqualia...

00:05:28.700 --> 00:05:29.660
I felt it, too.

00:05:29.960 --> 00:05:32.030
And it seems to be stronger than before.

00:05:32.320 --> 00:05:36.640
But I don't sense anything 
yet from Aichi Sendou.

00:05:36.640 --> 00:05:40.070
I wonder if he's going 
to use Psyqualia today...

00:05:42.890 --> 00:05:46.110
After all, he didn't use it 
during yesterday's match, right?

00:05:46.630 --> 00:05:48.450
Go, Enigman Storm!

00:05:48.750 --> 00:05:51.510
With Glory Maker's skill, the total is 33000!

00:05:54.880 --> 00:05:58.220
But I've done everything I can so far.

00:05:58.730 --> 00:06:00.790
I'll fight with all I've got!

00:06:01.350 --> 00:06:03.390
You came for me?

00:06:03.390 --> 00:06:05.610
See the king in his younger days 
as he blazes a trail with his knights!

00:06:07.150 --> 00:06:10.540
I ride... Alfred Early!

00:06:22.900 --> 00:06:25.670
But his opponent this time is Ren Suzugamori.

00:06:25.670 --> 00:06:27.640
I'm sure he'll use the power this time.

00:06:28.050 --> 00:06:30.450
There's no way he could beat Ren without it.

00:06:33.370 --> 00:06:36.110
I don't think Kourin likes that idea!

00:06:36.600 --> 00:06:38.450
Oh, I don't especially care...

00:06:38.450 --> 00:06:43.020
For our purposes, we need 
him to use the power today.

00:06:43.020 --> 00:06:44.170
Don't we, Suiko?

00:06:44.470 --> 00:06:50.410
That's right. When those two stand face to 
face and use Psyqualia at the same time,

00:06:50.410 --> 00:06:54.400
what we've been waiting for will happen.

00:06:53.920 --> 00:06:56.460
Third Match

00:06:56.260 --> 00:06:58.310
Thank you for your patience!

00:06:58.310 --> 00:07:01.340
We're here at the final round of 
the Vanguard National Championship!

00:07:01.340 --> 00:07:03.900
It's Team AL4 versus Team Q4!

00:07:03.900 --> 00:07:08.940
The fighters from both teams, Ren Suzugamori 
and Aichi Sendou, are taking the field!

00:07:14.720 --> 00:07:16.740
Good luck, Aichi!

00:07:18.210 --> 00:07:19.180
Aichi...

00:07:26.570 --> 00:07:28.650
You're a fool.

00:07:28.650 --> 00:07:31.910
It doesn't matter that you made it 
here. You're just going to lose.

00:07:31.910 --> 00:07:35.060
The win or loss isn't decided yet!

00:07:35.060 --> 00:07:36.980
It's impossible to beat me.

00:07:36.980 --> 00:07:39.130
You know it, don't you?

00:07:39.130 --> 00:07:43.550
As long as I have the power of 
Psyqualia, everything goes my way.

00:07:44.860 --> 00:07:47.350
This power <i>is</i> everything.

00:07:47.350 --> 00:07:51.040
And for he that possesses 
it, everything is allowed.

00:07:51.540 --> 00:07:55.770
I told you before... The 
powerless fall into despair

00:07:55.770 --> 00:07:59.100
and those with power get all the glory.

00:08:00.110 --> 00:08:03.530
I don't accept that way of thinking!

00:08:03.530 --> 00:08:04.440
What?

00:08:08.330 --> 00:08:12.760
Even though you have the 
ability, you reject Psyqualia?

00:08:13.510 --> 00:08:16.140
In that case, I'll help you remember

00:08:16.140 --> 00:08:18.620
just how powerful it is.

00:08:18.950 --> 00:08:22.000
Okay! Let's start the third match at last!

00:08:30.160 --> 00:08:31.940
Let the match begin!

00:08:31.940 --> 00:08:34.470
Stand up, Vanguard!

00:08:31.940 --> 00:08:34.470
Stand up the Vanguard!

00:08:55.280 --> 00:09:00.700
Aichi, you could see it too, 
couldn't you? My road to victory...

00:09:03.860 --> 00:09:07.960
You, too, will be brought to your 
knees as everything goes my way.

00:09:07.960 --> 00:09:10.430
Did you recall it a little bit...?

00:09:10.430 --> 00:09:12.940
The power of Psyqualia...

00:09:13.470 --> 00:09:18.470
I don't need to be reminded of 
how powerful Psyqualia is...

00:09:18.470 --> 00:09:20.290
But... I'm...

00:09:37.110 --> 00:09:39.880
I ride Blaster Javelin!

00:09:44.150 --> 00:09:45.630
Fullbau's skill!

00:09:53.020 --> 00:09:54.290
Turn end.

00:09:55.530 --> 00:09:56.490
Draw!

00:09:57.560 --> 00:09:58.930
I ride Marron!

00:10:02.660 --> 00:10:04.500
Wingal Brave moves!

00:10:06.290 --> 00:10:07.870
Gancelot's skill!

00:10:13.950 --> 00:10:14.870
Call!

00:10:17.650 --> 00:10:19.100
I attack Blaster Javelin!

00:10:21.870 --> 00:10:22.910
No guard.

00:10:23.640 --> 00:10:25.450
Drive trigger check!

00:10:30.840 --> 00:10:35.090
Wingal Brave boosts! Knight 
of Friendship, Kay attacks!

00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:38.470
I guard with Abyss Freezer.

00:10:45.840 --> 00:10:47.870
And now it's my turn, isn't it?

00:10:51.300 --> 00:10:54.860
Swallow up everything in darkness, my avatar!

00:10:56.200 --> 00:10:59.610
I ride Blaster Dark!

00:11:13.050 --> 00:11:13.820
Call.

00:11:14.600 --> 00:11:16.680
Skull Witch, Nemain.

00:11:18.770 --> 00:11:20.170
Counterblast.

00:11:26.840 --> 00:11:27.580
Call.

00:11:31.030 --> 00:11:33.480
Demon World Castle, DonnerSchlag,

00:11:33.480 --> 00:11:35.790
attack Knight of Friendship, Kay!

00:11:49.540 --> 00:11:54.580
Knight of Friendship, Kay can power 
up if the Vanguard is Blaster Blade...

00:11:54.580 --> 00:11:57.470
So he's going to annihilate 
any chance of that...

00:12:28.380 --> 00:12:30.430
I attack Marron with Blaster Dark.

00:12:33.500 --> 00:12:34.630
No guard!

00:12:35.060 --> 00:12:37.220
Check the drive trigger.

00:12:43.020 --> 00:12:46.270
And now, I think I'll let 
you taste it again...

00:12:46.750 --> 00:12:49.140
The power that you turned your back on!

00:12:51.020 --> 00:12:54.480
So... picture it...

00:12:55.250 --> 00:12:57.030
Blaster Dark...

00:12:57.550 --> 00:13:00.600
mowing you down with his sword!

00:13:10.360 --> 00:13:11.710
This is...

00:13:38.100 --> 00:13:39.900
D-Damage check.

00:13:45.940 --> 00:13:49.710
It felt like I really did 
just swing a sword...

00:13:50.060 --> 00:13:52.550
The power is overflowing, 
even into my body...

00:13:52.980 --> 00:13:54.850
Is this what happens?

00:13:56.560 --> 00:13:58.130
Gururubau boosts.

00:13:59.300 --> 00:14:02.050
I attack with Skull Witch, Nemain.

00:14:04.090 --> 00:14:04.990
No guard!

00:14:18.590 --> 00:14:22.190
It appears that my Psyqualia 
is getting stronger.

00:14:22.790 --> 00:14:24.610
And for that purpose...

00:14:25.460 --> 00:14:27.910
His imagination has gotten stronger, too!

00:14:28.310 --> 00:14:32.770
You've never felt so humiliated 
and powerless, have you?

00:14:35.200 --> 00:14:40.440
This power really is 
wonderful... Don't you agree?

00:14:40.440 --> 00:14:44.080
This is Psyqualia, the 
power that you rejected.

00:14:47.120 --> 00:14:50.350
I didn't reject Psyqualia.

00:14:53.100 --> 00:15:00.110
But the power is too strong... If I used it 
now, I would get addicted to its strength.

00:15:00.110 --> 00:15:01.740
Like I was before...

00:15:01.740 --> 00:15:04.330
And like you are now, Ren.

00:15:10.360 --> 00:15:12.570
That's why... I'm...

00:15:15.750 --> 00:15:16.530
That's...

00:15:17.120 --> 00:15:19.500
Here it comes! Brother's avatar!

00:15:20.220 --> 00:15:22.510
Stand up, my avatar!

00:15:22.880 --> 00:15:26.340
I ride... Blaster Blade!

00:15:28.290 --> 00:15:32.480
So I don't become what I was, 
I refuse to use Psyqualia!

00:15:33.340 --> 00:15:35.840
Instead, I'm gonna fight 
with everything I've got!

00:15:57.670 --> 00:15:59.170
Counterblast!

00:16:01.960 --> 00:16:04.550
DonnerSchlag exits the field!

00:16:07.780 --> 00:16:08.770
Call!

00:16:13.400 --> 00:16:14.850
Marron, please.

00:16:22.200 --> 00:16:26.470
Drive check! Critical trigger!

00:16:27.360 --> 00:16:29.730
I add +5000 to the power of Bedivere!

00:16:30.880 --> 00:16:33.560
And I give the extra 
critical to Blaster Blade!

00:16:34.320 --> 00:16:36.080
That makes it a 2 critical!

00:16:36.080 --> 00:16:37.280
Go!!

00:16:42.970 --> 00:16:44.070
Stupid...

00:16:44.800 --> 00:16:48.350
Do you really think you can 
win when I'm using Psyqualia?

00:16:48.660 --> 00:16:51.290
You trampled on Kai's feelings,

00:16:51.290 --> 00:16:55.390
when he tried desperately 
to save you, as your friend!

00:16:57.260 --> 00:17:00.470
I'm going to use this 
power to take everything.

00:17:00.470 --> 00:17:02.710
And nothing can stop me.

00:17:03.640 --> 00:17:04.900
<i>No one.</i>

00:17:06.510 --> 00:17:07.360
Ren!

00:17:11.320 --> 00:17:12.200
Ren!

00:17:17.430 --> 00:17:17.900
Kai!

00:17:18.350 --> 00:17:19.190
Get away from me!

00:17:21.180 --> 00:17:22.760
Leave me alone!

00:17:25.060 --> 00:17:27.910
Kai's feelings didn't reach you...

00:17:28.400 --> 00:17:29.270
What?

00:17:29.840 --> 00:17:34.080
Hooked on almighty power, you 
think it's okay to do anything!

00:17:34.080 --> 00:17:36.720
I don't wanna become like that!

00:17:36.980 --> 00:17:38.690
You're making a mistake!

00:17:49.850 --> 00:17:53.050
With a boost from Wingal 
Brave, Bedivere attacks!

00:17:56.400 --> 00:17:59.660
Bedivere's skill increases 
his power by +3000!

00:18:05.330 --> 00:18:09.530
Heal trigger. I heal 1 point of damage.

00:18:13.710 --> 00:18:17.380
You thought you dealt me 3 
damage this turn, didn't you?

00:18:17.380 --> 00:18:21.710
But I foresaw this development 
from the beginning.

00:18:24.670 --> 00:18:27.190
Still, now I understand...

00:18:27.190 --> 00:18:30.720
It's not Psyqualia that you're rejecting...

00:18:31.310 --> 00:18:33.670
It's <i>me</i>.

00:18:38.570 --> 00:18:41.420
That boy says he refuses...

00:18:41.420 --> 00:18:43.340
What if he really doesn't use it?

00:18:44.720 --> 00:18:46.250
Let's wait and see.

00:18:50.930 --> 00:18:55.630
Cursed dragon, come out and 
muster your dark power!

00:18:55.630 --> 00:18:59.260
I ride Phantom Blaster Dragon!

00:19:08.130 --> 00:19:12.000
When Blaster Dark is in the Soul, 
Phantom Blaster Dragon...

00:19:12.800 --> 00:19:14.670
...gets +1000 power!

00:19:18.420 --> 00:19:19.490
Brother...

00:19:23.330 --> 00:19:24.410
Call.

00:19:28.480 --> 00:19:29.390
Here it comes...

00:19:29.790 --> 00:19:30.880
Yeah...

00:19:30.880 --> 00:19:34.110
That Damned... whatever thing!

00:19:34.700 --> 00:19:36.710
It's Damned Charging Lance.

00:19:36.710 --> 00:19:38.560
DCL, yo!

00:19:38.560 --> 00:19:39.520
Aichi...

00:19:43.860 --> 00:19:45.350
Here I go, Aichi.

00:19:45.990 --> 00:19:48.420
Phantom Blaster Dragon's skill...

00:19:52.120 --> 00:19:54.810
Damned Charging Lance.

00:19:54.810 --> 00:19:59.020
Nemain, Gururubau, Darkside Trumpeter!

00:20:01.400 --> 00:20:06.570
There it is! Phantom Blaster Dragon's 
skill, Damned Charging Lance!

00:20:06.570 --> 00:20:07.660
Indeed.

00:20:07.660 --> 00:20:12.130
It's a heartless skill that raises your 
power by sacrificing three of your own units.

00:20:12.130 --> 00:20:15.670
Right! So how is Sendou 
going to react to it?!

00:20:23.330 --> 00:20:26.680
Brother, hang in there!

00:20:27.130 --> 00:20:28.070
Aichi...

00:20:33.990 --> 00:20:36.550
Sacrifice yourselves to the cursed dragon!

00:20:55.310 --> 00:20:57.020
Interesting...

00:20:58.180 --> 00:21:04.440
The power fills up inside my body just 
as it does with Phantom Blaster Dragon...

00:21:07.770 --> 00:21:11.580
Ren's Psyqualia power keeps on increasing!

00:21:38.520 --> 00:21:40.230
As long as I have this power,

00:21:40.530 --> 00:21:43.140
I can do what I want with you...

00:21:46.530 --> 00:21:49.740
It's boring to just humiliate you.

00:21:50.090 --> 00:21:53.170
I think I'll transform you

00:21:53.170 --> 00:21:55.470
into the very thing you hate the most.

00:23:50.620 --> 00:23:55.350
True power is marshaled through 
the manifestation of Psyqualia.

00:23:55.670 --> 00:23:59.550
You would do well to accept 
that undisputed truth, Aichi.

00:23:59.550 --> 00:24:00.900
But it isn't true.

00:24:01.050 --> 00:24:04.730
I can't afford to get addicted to 
power and lose sight of myself!

00:24:05.510 --> 00:24:07.590
What are you afraid of?

00:24:07.590 --> 00:24:11.340
At any rate, your softhearted 
utterances end here!

00:24:11.340 --> 00:24:13.760
Next time: The Truth of Psyqualia!

00:24:13.760 --> 00:24:17.020
The other me that's deep 
inside me is seeking power!

00:24:17.020 --> 00:24:19.490
The image I have is closing 
in... and I can't stop it!
